<title>INDONESIA: Putra Surya H1 net soars.</title>
<headline>Putra Surya H1 net soars.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  43.26 vs 28.40</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)   49 vs 90</p>
<p>    Net revenues		     173.54 vs 194.43</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  56.53 vs 78.08</p>
<p>    Expenses			     3.02 vs 34.33</p>
<p>Note: PT Putra Suyra Perkasa said a drop in earnings per share reflected a sharp increase in the number of shares to 997.5 million in 1996 against 315 million in 1995.</p>
</text>
